### ============================================================
### LOGOUT
### ============================================================

### Logout - valid refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### Logout - invalid refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "this-is-not-a-valid-refresh-token"
}


### Logout - empty refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}


### Logout - missing refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}
